    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18226" root="زند" body-key="z">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ازند</span></b> , (K,) said of a man, (TA,) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَادَ</span>
[<i>He exceeded,</i> &amp;c.]. (K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence, app.,]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا يُزْنِدُكَ أَحَدٌ عَلَيْهِ</span>, as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ما يُزَنِّدُكَ</span></b> , <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَزِيدُكَ</span> [meaning <i>No one is more sufficient for
thee than he:</i> see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زيد</span>]: (K:) or <i>no one exceeds him to thee in excellence.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ازند فِى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجَعِهِ</span> <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجَعَ</span> [i. e. <i>He relapsed in his pain.</i>] (K.)

